| Quarter      | `quarter`     | `lightning__IntegerType` | ❌ Optional | ✅ Collect              | "Enter the quarter number (1–4). Leave blank to include all quarters." |
| Vendor       | `vendor`      | `lightning__TextType`    | ❌ Optional | ✅ Collect              | "Filter by vendor if specified (e.g., Siemens, GE, Philips)."          |
| Modality     | `modality`    | `lightning__TextType`    | ❌ Optional | ✅ Collect              | "Filter by modality (e.g., MRI, CT, Ultrasound). Leave blank for all." |
| Order Status | `orderStatus` | `lightning__TextType`    | ❌ Optional | ✅ Collect              | "Filter by order status (e.g., Completed, Pending, Cancelled)."        |

